{# Section order, visibility and styling come from src/_data/getInvolved.json,
   editable under Site Pages → Get Involved in the Content Manager. The newsletter
   and share sections are "custom" blocks — reorderable and hideable, but their
   internals live in components/custom/ because they carry forms and scripts.

   The four ways to help are tiled 2x2 rather than stacked, so someone can take in
   every option without scrolling and pick the one that fits. The banner renders
   first, full-bleed; everything after it becomes a card in the grid below.

   indexOffset keeps data-block-index pointing at each block's real position in
   the JSON array — the inline editor writes back by that number. #}
{% set blocks = [getInvolved.blocks[0]] %}
{% include "components/block-renderer.njk" %}

{# 4-across on large screens puts all four options above the fold; 2x2 on tablet,
   stacked on phones. #}
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8">
  <div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
    {% set blocks = getInvolved.blocks.slice(1) %}
    {% set indexOffset = 1 %}
    {% set inGrid = true %}
    {% include "components/block-renderer.njk" %}
  </div>
</div>
